          "heading": "Fiji registered a 63-10 home victory against Canada in September 2025",
          "body": "In the senior men's international side's last 11 matches, Fiji recorded their largest victory by beating Canada 63-10 at home in the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage in September 2025. Across this same 11-game span, the team scored 314 points in total. They conceded 351 points during the same period, which represents an average of 31.9 points conceded per match. Offensively, the side averaged 28.5 points scored per game over those 11 fixtures."
