          "heading": "Peter O’Mahony details his disappointment following Rassie Erasmus’ Munster departure",
          "body": "Former Ireland captain Peter O’Mahony has revealed the personal toll taken by Rassie Erasmus’ decision to leave his role as Munster director of rugby at the end of 2017. Reflecting in his book, All In, O’Mahony admitted he felt \"hurt\" by the departure, noting that he had fully bought into Erasmus’ game plan and believed the coach was providing the necessary direction for the side. While O’Mahony acknowledged the ruthlessness of professional sport, the loss remained a difficult period."
